	"Description": "An Okta API token was enabled or had its settings changed. Re-enabling a token that was parked, or relaxing the network condition on one, restores a credential that bypasses interactive sign-in.\n\nEvent types: system.api_token.enable, system.api_token.update\n\nReference(s):\n- https://developer.okta.com/docs/reference/api/event-types/\n- https://developer.okta.com/docs/api/openapi/okta-management/management/tag/SystemLog/\n\nThis scheduled search is a dispatcher on \"Alert - Okta - Alert Router\". Its name is what appears as the alert name, so rename it here if you want the alerts named differently.\n\nIt ships disabled; enable it once you have reviewed the query and are happy with the volume it produces.",
